    "title": "Yesu na Shetani",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "yesu na shetani",
    "language": "swh",
    "review_level": "None",
    "content": "<p>Shetani ni wakala binafsi wa dhambi na uovu ambaye alimpinga Yesu (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:1-Matt4:11\">Mathayo 4:1–11</a>).</p><p>Injili ya Mathayo inamrejelea kiumbe huyu kama:</p><ul><li><p>“Shetani,” ambayo inamaanisha <em>mpinzani</em> au <em>mshindani</em> (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:10\">4:10</a>)</p></li><li><p>“Shetani” (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:1-Matt4:11\">4:1–11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:39\">13:39</a>)</p></li><li><p>&quot;Mjaribu&quot; (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:3\">4:3</a>)</p></li><li><p>&quot;mfalme wa mapepo&quot; (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt9:34\">9:34</a>)</p></li><li><p>“Beelzebuli” (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt12:24\">12:24</a>)</p></li><li><p>“mwenye uovu” (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt6:13\">6:13</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:19\">13:19</a>)</p></li><li><p>“Adui” (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:39\">13:39</a>)</p></li></ul><p>Ujumbe wa Yesu wa kutangaza na kuleta ufalme wa Mungu duniani ulisababisha migogoro na majeshi ya Shetani. Hii ilihusisha kuondoa pepo waliokuwa wakiwamiliki watu (kufukuza pepo) (tazama <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt8:16-Matt8:17\">Mathayo 8:16–17</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt9:32-Matt9:34\">9:32–34</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt10:1\">10:1</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt10:7-Matt10:8\">7–8</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt12:22-Matt12:29\">12:22–29</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Mark5:1-Mark5:20\">Marko 5:1–20</a>). Mathayo anabainisha kwamba Shetani ana nguvu juu ya falme (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:8-Matt4:9\">Mathayo 4:8–9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt12:26\">12:26</a>). Pia anaamuru malaika (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt25:41\">25:41</a>).</p><p>Njia kuu ya Shetani ya kusababisha madhara ni kupitia majaribu. Kusudi lake ni kuwafanya watu wasimtii Mungu (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:1-Matt4:11\">Mathayo 4:1–11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt6:13\">6:13</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt16:23\">16:23</a>). Kama wakala wa Mungu kwa ajili ya wokovu wa binadamu, Yesu alikumbana na mashambulizi makali kutoka kwa Shetani (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:1-Matt4:11\">Mathayo 4:1–11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/John13:27\">Yohana 13:27</a>). Hata hivyo, Yesu alimshinda Shetani na hatimaye ataondoa nguvu zake zote (<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt25:41\">Mathayo 25:41</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/John12:31\">Yohana 12:31</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rev20:1-Rev20:10\">Ufunuo 20:1–10</a>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><a href=\"https://ref.ly/Job1:6-Job1:12\">Ayubu 1:6–12</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Job2:1-Job2:7\">2:1–7</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Zech3:1-Zech3:2\">Zekaria 3:1–2</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt4:1-Matt4:11\">Mathayo 4:1–11</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt13:19\">13:19</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt16:23\">16:23</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke10:17-Luke10:20\">Luka 10:17–20</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke13:16\">13:16</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke22:3\">22:3</a>, <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke22:31-Luke22:32\">31–32</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/John12:31\">Yohana 12:31</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/John13:27\">13:27</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Acts5:3\">Matendo 5:3</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Acts26:17-Acts26:18\">26:17–18</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Cor4:4\">2 Wakorintho 4:4</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/2Cor11:13-2Cor11:14\">11:13–14</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Tim2:14\">1 Timotheo 2:14</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Tim5:15\">5:15</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rev12:9\">Ufunuo 12:9</a>; <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rev20:1-Rev20:10\">20:1–10</a></p>",
